{"version":1,"key":"card:252","content":{"id":252,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":5353,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":686,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"instanceof","code":true}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是用来判断某个对象是否是某个函数的实例，如果该函数在这个对象的原型链上，那么这个对象就是这个函数的实例。在 ES6 中，我们可以 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.hasInstance","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来改变这一默认行为"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"obj instanceof Array;\n// 相当于\nArray[Symbol.hasInstance](obj);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"e503d404-8d41-4a9b-8736-242ce204bace","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过改变构造函数的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.hasInstance","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，即可改变这一行为。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"必须通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Object.defineProperty","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来重写 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.hasInstance","code":true},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"function Person(name) {\n  this.name = name;\n}\n\nlet alice = new Person(\"alice\");\n// 默认行为\nconsole.log(alice instanceof Person); // true\n\n// 更改 instanceof 行为\nObject.defineProperty(Person, Symbol.hasInstance, {\n  value: function (instance) {\n    return false;\n  },\n});\n\nconsole.log(alice instanceof Person); // false","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b7748030-493d-4872-980a-ba0bf30a0705","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.hasInstance","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法接收一个参数，这个参数就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"instanceof","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 前面的那个对象"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["JavaScript/Symbol","JavaScript/原型","JavaScript/instanceof"],"createTime":1690986265004,"updateTime":1772030700771,"linkedCards":[{"id":249,"target":{"key":"card:249","type":"card","id":249},"summary":"Symbol 是 ES6 引入的一种新的原始类型，类型的值唯一的，每个被创建出来的 Symbol 变量都是不同的，这是 Symbol 这种数据类型最大的特点，常常用于作为对象的属性，以防止被不正确篡改。 Symbol 不能通过字面量来进行创...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1772030700771},"links":{"card:686":{"key":"card:686","type":"card","id":686}}}